desc: Increment all numbers by 1
category: macro
par: 10
hint1: Ctrl-A increments numbers in normal mode
hint2: Record a macro: Ctrl-A finds the next number on the line and increments it
solution: qa<C-A>l<C-A>+q4@a
note: Record macro a: <C-A> increments a number, l steps onto the next, <C-A> again,
note: + drops to the next line; q ends it. 4@a replays it on the remaining 4 lines.
--- START ---
item 1: value 10
item 2: value 20
item 3: value 30
item 4: value 40
item 5: value 50
--- GOAL ---
item 2: value 11
item 3: value 21
item 4: value 31
item 5: value 41
item 6: value 51
--- END ---
